OL,3,APlan to tag proflifc shoplifters as
OL,4,Apolice and retailers battle to regain
OL,5,Acontrol
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 500,000 shoplifting offences
OL,8,Fwere recorded by police forces in
OL,9,FEngland last year ` and just over half
OL,10,Fwere closed without an identified
OL,11,Fsuspect
OL,13,FWhile out reporting on the issue, a BBC
OL,14,Fteam witnessed a pair of shoplifters in
OL,15,Faction
OL,17,FOne shop owner said she keeps the doors
OL,18,Flocked during opening hours, while
OL,19,Fanother describes being dragged over
OL,20,Fthe counter
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
