OL,3,APlan to tag proflifc shoplifters as
OL,4,Apolice and retailers battle to regain
OL,5,Acontrol
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeveral retailers have told us this
OL,8,Fcrime is out of control, but Policing
OL,9,FMinister Sarah Jones thinks progress is
OL,10,Fbeing made
OL,12,FShops and communities have been finding
OL,13,Fways to fight back, including posting
OL,14,FCCTV images to social media and a Shop
OL,15,FWatch scheme on WhatsApp
OL,17,FCheck the shoplifting figures for your
OL,18,Flocal area using our lookup tool
